<% const asset = name => url_for('/images/meshy/' + name); const home = page.portfolio_home || '/brand-creative/'; %>
<article class="mx-case">
<header class="mx-hero" id="home"><img class="mx-hero-art" src="<%- asset('ideas-take-shape.webp') %>" alt="Meshy 云狐品牌传播概念主视觉" fetchpriority="high"><div class="mx-hero-top"><img src="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" alt="Meshy"><span>BRAND CAMPAIGN SYSTEM<br>VOL. 02 / 2026</span></div><div class="mx-hero-copy"><span class="mx-kicker">IMAGINATION, IN A NEW DIMENSION.</span><h1>Ideas<br>take <i>shape.</i></h1><p class="mx-chinese">想象，有了形状。</p><a href="#mx-system" class="mx-pill">查看视觉系统 <span>↘</span></a></div><div class="mx-hero-bottom"><span>ART DIRECTION / DESIGN SYSTEM / CAMPAIGN</span><span>自主概念提案 · 非官方委托</span></div></header>
<nav class="mx-index" aria-label="项目章节"><a href="#mx-direction">创意探索</a><a href="#mx-system">标识规范</a><a href="#mx-type">字体与语言</a><a href="#mx-grid">栅格与间距</a><a href="#mx-color">色彩系统</a><a href="#mx-campaign">传播应用</a><a href="#mx-process">AI 与交付</a></nav>
<section class="ms-brief"><h2>从一张图像，<br>到一套品牌语言。</h2><div><span>受众 / 视觉创作者</span><span>目标 / 激发第一次 3D 创作</span><span>概念 / 让想法走出平面</span></div><p>围绕 Meshy 的图片到 3D 能力进行自主命题。以下为本次 Campaign 提案规范；保留官方标识，不替代官方品牌手册。</p></section>
<section class="ms-section ms-dark" id="mx-direction"><header class="ms-head"><span>01 / ART DIRECTION</span><h2>先比较，再决定。</h2><p>同一传播目标，三种视觉重心。</p></header><div class="ms-routes"><figure><div class="ms-route ms-route-type"><small>MESHY / EXPLORATION A</small><strong>What<br>if<span>?</span></strong><em>EVERY IDEA STARTS HERE.</em></div><figcaption><b>A · 字体驱动</b><span>信息直接，3D 特征较弱。</span></figcaption></figure><figure><div class="ms-route ms-route-frame"><img src="<%- asset('ideas-take-shape.webp') %>" alt="方向 B：立体角色与二维画框" loading="lazy"><span>SELECTED / B</span></div><figcaption><b>B · 维度跨越 ↗</b><span>让输入与结果形成直观关系。</span></figcaption></figure><figure><div class="ms-route ms-route-family"><span>More than<br>one possibility.</span><img src="<%- asset('form-family.webp') %>" alt="方向 C：玻璃与白瓷的多形态视觉族群" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption><b>C · 形态族群</b><span>用于系列扩展，避免首屏多焦点。</span></figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="ms-section ms-paper" id="mx-system"><header class="ms-head"><span>02 / BRAND SIGNATURE</span><h2>识别，先有边界。</h2><p>本提案定义的数字传播使用规则。</p></header><div class="ms-logo-board"><div class="ms-board-label"><b>01. CLEAR SPACE</b><span>x = 标识高度的 ¼</span></div><svg class="ms-logo-diagram" viewBox="0 0 560 240" role="img" aria-label="Meshy 标识四周至少保留四分之一标识高度的安全区"><defs><pattern id="ms-dots" width="16" height="16" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="1" cy="1" r=".7" fill="#576a5e" opacity=".25"/></pattern></defs><rect width="560" height="240" fill="url(#ms-dots)"/><rect x="180" y="72" width="199" height="96" fill="#c5f955" fill-opacity=".14" stroke="#81a543" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><rect x="196" y="88" width="167" height="64" fill="none" stroke="#c5f955"/><image href="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" x="196" y="88" width="167" height="64"/><g fill="none" stroke="#98ac9e" stroke-width=".7"><path d="M196 64V180 M363 64V180 M172 88H389 M172 152H389 M403 88v64 M399 88h8 M399 152h8"/></g><g fill="#c5f955" font-size="11" font-family="Inter, sans-serif"><text x="275" y="83">x</text><text x="275" y="164">x</text><text x="185" y="124">x</text><text x="367" y="124">x</text><text x="412" y="125">4x</text></g></svg><div class="ms-board-footer"><span>示例：H 64px → x 16px</span><span>安全区内不放文字、图像与其他标识</span></div></div><div class="ms-logo-details"><div><small>02. MINIMUM SIZE / 屏幕</small><div class="ms-min-logo"><img src="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" alt="最小建议宽度 96px 的 Meshy 标识"><span>← 96px →</span></div><p>建议最小宽度 96px；使用原始 SVG。</p></div><div><small>03. SURFACE / 背景</small><div class="ms-logo-surfaces"><div><img src="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" alt="深绿底色上的官方标识"></div><div><img src="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" alt="暖白底色上的官方标识"></div></div><p>优先放在稳定、无细节干扰的背景。</p></div><div><small>04. DO NOT / 错误示意</small><div class="ms-logo-wrong"><img src="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" alt="错误示意：被横向拉伸的标识"><b>×</b></div><p>不拉伸、不改色、不增加描边与发光。</p></div></div></section>
<section class="ms-section ms-paper" id="mx-type"><header class="ms-head"><span>03 / TYPOGRAPHY & LOCALIZATION</span><h2>两种语言，同一种语气。</h2><p>英文紧凑有力，中文保留阅读节奏。</p></header><div class="ms-font-pair"><div><small>LATIN / INTER</small><strong>Aa Gg Rr</strong><span>ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ<br>abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz<br>0123456789 &amp; ?! / @</span></div><div lang="zh-CN"><small>CJK / NOTO SANS SC</small><strong>想象有形</strong><span>让一个想法，走出平面。<br>简洁 · 自信 · 富有创造力<br>0123456789 「」· ，。</span></div></div><div class="ms-board-label ms-label-light"><b>TYPE SCALE / 1440px 设计基准</b><span>画板按比例显示 · px / 行高 / 字距</span></div><div class="ms-type-scale"><div><small>DISPLAY / 600<br>96 / 96 / −0.04em</small><strong>Ideas take shape.</strong></div><div><small>HEADLINE / 600<br>64 / 72 / −0.03em</small><h3>A new dimension.</h3></div><div><small>ZH HEADLINE / 500<br>56 / 68 / 0</small><h3 lang="zh-CN">想象，有了形状。</h3></div><div><small>BODY / 400<br>16 / 26 / 0</small><p>Bring your next idea into a new dimension.<br>从一张图像，开启你的 3D 创作探索。</p></div><div><small>LABEL / 500<br>12 / 16 / 0.08em</small><span>CREATE SOMETHING ONLY YOU CAN IMAGINE.</span></div></div><div class="ms-locale-pair"><figure class="ms-locale en"><small>EN / MASTER</small><h3>Ideas<br>take shape.</h3><span class="ms-baseline"></span><p>Bring your imagination into a new dimension.</p><span class="ms-sample-cta">Explore Meshy ↗</span><figcaption>短句 · 语义断行 · 句首大写</figcaption></figure><figure class="ms-locale zh" lang="zh-CN"><small>ZH-CN / ADAPTATION</small><h3>想象，<br>有了形状。</h3><span class="ms-baseline"></span><p>让一个想法，拥有更多可能。</p><span class="ms-sample-cta">开启创作探索 ↗</span><figcaption>按意思重写 · 标点不悬挂 · 不压缩字宽</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="ms-section ms-dark" id="mx-grid"><header class="ms-head"><span>04 / GRID & SPACING</span><h2>自由表达，有据可循。</h2><p>实际画板叠加栅格，展示对齐与留白。</p></header><div class="ms-toolbar"><div><b>1440 × 810</b><span>12 栏 / 页边距 72 / 栏距 24 / 栏宽 86</span></div><button type="button" data-ms-grid aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="ms-grid-canvas">隐藏栅格</button></div><div class="ms-grid-canvas show-grid" id="ms-grid-canvas"><img class="ms-grid-art" src="<%- asset('ideas-take-shape.webp') %>" alt="12 栏网格下的品牌主视觉构图" loading="lazy"><div class="ms-grid-content"><img src="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" alt="Meshy"><h3>Ideas<br>take shape.</h3><p>想象，有了形状。</p><span>Explore your next dimension ↗</span></div><div class="ms-grid-overlay" aria-hidden="true"><% for(let i=1;i<=12;i++){ %><i><span><%= String(i).padStart(2,'0') %></span></i><% } %></div><div class="ms-grid-guides" aria-hidden="true"><span>72</span><span>TEXT / 1—6</span><span>FORM / 7—12</span><span>72</span></div></div><div class="ms-spacing-board"><div class="ms-spacing-title"><strong>8</strong><div><b>BASE UNIT / px</b><p>以 8px 为基础建立间距节奏。</p></div></div><div class="ms-spacing-scale"><% [8,16,24,32,48,64,96].forEach(function(n){ %><div><i style="width:<%= n %>px;height:<%= n %>px"></i><span><%= n %></span></div><% }); %></div></div><div class="ms-spacing-examples"><div><small>COMPONENT / 元素间距</small><div class="ms-measure-button"><span>24</span><b>Explore Meshy</b><i>16</i><b>↗</b><span>24</span></div><p>水平内边距 24 · 图文间距 16 · 高度 48</p></div><div><small>CONTENT / 文本组</small><div class="ms-content-measure"><b>Ideas take shape.</b><i>↕ 24</i><span>Bring your imagination into a new dimension.</span><i>↕ 32</i><em>Explore Meshy ↗</em></div></div><div><small>RESPONSIVE / 布局转换</small><div class="ms-grid-mini"><div><% for(let i=0;i<12;i++){ %><i></i><% } %></div><span>12 COL / 1440</span><div><% for(let i=0;i<4;i++){ %><i></i><% } %></div><span>4 COL / 390 · 边距 24 · 栏距 16</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="ms-section ms-paper" id="mx-color"><header class="ms-head"><span>05 / COLOR BEHAVIOR</span><h2>色彩，是秩序的一部分。</h2><p>用中性色承载内容，用亮绿引导行动。</p></header><div class="ms-color-ratio"><div style="flex:60;background:#071b15;color:#eeeee7"><b>60%</b><span>FOREST</span></div><div style="flex:25;background:#eeeee7;color:#071b15"><b>25%</b><span>PAPER</span></div><div style="flex:12;background:#c5f955;color:#071b15"><b>12%</b><span>LIME</span></div><div style="flex:3;background:#ff3e8f"><span>3%</span></div></div><div class="ms-color-values"><span>#071B15 / 舞台</span><span>#EEEEE7 / 阅读</span><span>#C5F955 / 行动</span><span>#FF3E8F / 点缀</span></div><div class="ms-color-pair"><div><span>Aa</span><b>正文 / 深绿 × 暖白</b><p>稳定的内容阅读组合。</p></div><div><span>Aa ↗</span><b>行动 / 深绿 × 亮绿</b><p>CTA 保持深色文字。</p></div><div><span>Aa <b>×</b></span><b>避免 / 亮绿 × 暖白</b><p>不用于小字号文字。</p></div></div><p class="ms-note">60 / 25 / 12 / 3 为本次 Campaign 的配色建议，不要求每张物料机械遵守；亮绿与粉色取自官方标识。</p></section>
<section class="ms-section ms-paper" id="mx-imagery"><header class="ms-head"><span>06 / IMAGE MAKING</span><h2>同一种材质，不止一个主角。</h2><p>形态可以变化，色彩、光线与触感保持连续。</p></header><figure class="ms-family"><img src="<%- asset('form-family.webp') %>" alt="白瓷与亮绿玻璃构成的花朵、飞鸟、环形结视觉族群" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>BOTANICAL / 生长</span><span>CHARACTER / 生命</span><span>ABSTRACT / 可能</span></figcaption></figure><div class="ms-material-rules"><div><span class="ms-material-orb porcelain"></span><b>PORCELAIN</b><p>白瓷主体 · 柔和高光</p></div><div><span class="ms-material-orb glass"></span><b>LIME GLASS</b><p>亮绿体积 · 透明折射</p></div><div><span class="ms-material-orb pink"></span><b>PINK ACCENT</b><p>局部点缀 · 不抢主体</p></div><div><span class="ms-light-diagram">↘<i></i></span><b>STUDIO LIGHT</b><p>柔光主光 · 清楚轮廓</p></div></div><div class="ms-image-decision"><figure><img src="<%- asset('ideas-take-shape.webp') %>" alt="左侧留白的完整主视觉构图" loading="lazy"><span class="ms-safe-copy">COPY ZONE<br>35%</span><figcaption>保留完整轮廓与文案区 ✓</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="<%- asset('ideas-take-shape.webp') %>" alt="错误示意：过度裁切使头部和尾巴失去完整轮廓" loading="lazy"><figcaption>避免无目的地截断主体 ×</figcaption></figure></div><p class="ms-note">图像为 AI 生成的二维概念素材；材质与光线规则用于指导本次视觉探索，不代表真实 Meshy 模型或建模过程。</p></section>
<section class="ms-section ms-dark" id="mx-campaign"><header class="ms-head"><span>07 / GLOBAL CAMPAIGN KIT</span><h2>一套系统，进入真实画幅。</h2><p>中英文分别排版；适配改变构图，不拉伸画面。</p></header><div class="ms-campaign-pair"><figure class="ms-final-poster"><img class="ms-final-art" src="<%- asset('ideas-take-shape.webp') %>" alt="英文版品牌传播海报" loading="lazy"><img class="ms-final-logo" src="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" alt="Meshy"><div><small>YOUR NEXT DIMENSION</small><h3>Ideas<br>take shape.</h3><p>Make space for your imagination.</p></div><figcaption>EN / 1080 × 1350 <span>Explore Meshy ↗</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="ms-final-poster ms-final-light"><img class="ms-final-art" src="<%- asset('form-family.webp') %>" alt="中文版飞鸟品牌传播海报" loading="lazy"><img class="ms-final-logo" src="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" alt="Meshy"><div lang="zh-CN"><small>给想象，多一个维度。</small><h3>想象，<br>有了形状。</h3><p>从一张图像，开启新的创作可能。</p></div><figcaption>ZH-CN / 1080 × 1350 <span>开启创作探索 ↗</span></figcaption></figure></div><div class="ms-format-label"><b>FORMAT FAMILY</b><span>同一视觉资产 · 四种传播节奏</span></div><div class="ms-format-family"><% [{c:'square',r:'1:1',s:'1080 × 1080',t:'Ideas take shape.'},{c:'portrait',r:'4:5',s:'1080 × 1350',t:'Ideas take shape.'},{c:'story',r:'9:16',s:'1080 × 1920',t:'Imagine. Create.'},{c:'wide',r:'16:9',s:'1920 × 1080',t:'A new dimension.'}].forEach(function(f){ %><figure class="ms-format <%= f.c %>"><div><img src="<%- asset('ideas-take-shape.webp') %>" alt="<%= f.r %> 品牌画幅适配示意" loading="lazy"><strong><%= f.t %></strong><span>Meshy ↗</span></div><figcaption><b><%= f.r %></b><span><%= f.s %></span></figcaption></figure><% }); %></div><div class="ms-wide-banner"><img src="<%- asset('form-family.webp') %>" alt="用于宽屏展台或活动屏幕的品牌视觉系列" loading="lazy"><div><img src="<%- asset('meshy-logo.svg') %>" alt="Meshy"><h3>More than<br>one possibility.</h3><p>CREATOR EVENT / DIGITAL BACKDROP CONCEPT</p></div></div></section>
<section class="ms-section ms-paper" id="mx-process"><header class="ms-head"><span>08 / PROCESS & HANDOFF</span><h2>把探索，沉淀成可复用资产。</h2><p>本轮实际制作链路，没有虚构提效数字。</p></header><div class="ms-process-strip"><div><small>01 / DIRECTION</small><div class="ms-prompt-card">ONE SUBJECT<br>PORCELAIN + GLASS<br>35% COPY SPACE<br>NO GENERATED TEXT</div><b>把方向写成视觉约束</b></div><div><small>02 / REFERENCE</small><img src="<%- asset('ideas-take-shape.webp') %>" alt="本次 AI 主视觉输出" loading="lazy"><b>首图确定主体与材质</b></div><div><small>03 / EXPLORATION</small><img src="<%- asset('material-study.webp') %>" alt="以主图为参考的材质探索，非真实拓扑" loading="lazy"><b>参考图延展材质处理</b></div><div><small>04 / SYSTEM</small><div class="ms-handoff-tile"><span>Aa / 字</span><i></i><p>8 · 16 · 24 · 32</p></div><b>规则化排版与尺寸适配</b></div></div><div class="ms-handoff"><div><small>DELIVERY STRUCTURE</small><code>01_Brand / Logo · Color<br>02_Type / EN · ZH-CN<br>03_Campaign / KV · Social · Wide<br>04_Motion / 12s web study</code></div><div><small>REVIEW GATES</small><span>标识完整 / 字体层级 / 安全区</span><span>语言断行 / 主体裁切 / 色彩组合</span><span>实际导出 / 产品实测 / 投放反馈 → 待验证</span></div></div><div class="ms-motion-head"><b>MOTION STUDY / 12s</b><span>出现 → 成形 → 展开</span></div>
    <div class="mx-motion" data-mx-motion>
      <img src="<%- asset('ideas-take-shape.webp') %>" alt="动效第三幕的品牌概念画面" loading="lazy">
      <div class="mx-motion-frame"></div><div class="mx-motion-words"><span>A thought.</span><span>A form.</span><span>Ideas take shape.</span></div>
      <div class="mx-motion-controls"><button type="button" data-mx-play aria-label="播放 12 秒品牌动效">播放动效 ↗</button><span data-mx-time role="status">12 秒 · 网页动效示意</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-motion-beats"><span>00—04s / 想法出现</span><span>04—08s / 边界成形</span><span>08—12s / 创意展开</span></div>

<details class="ms-project-notes"><summary>项目说明与素材来源</summary><p>自主品牌传播提案，非官方委托。官方标识来自 <a href="https://www.meshy.ai/zh/?noRedirect=true" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meshy 官网</a>；新增视觉为 AI 辅助生成的二维概念图。受众与策略为设计假设，未进行真实投放与 Meshy 产品生成验证。本页数值为本次提案制定的数字设计基准，非官方品牌规范。</p></details></section>
